'''Annagh United Football Club''', referred to as '''Annagh United''', is a semi-professional, [[Northern Ireland|Northern Irish]] [[football (soccer)|football]] club playing in the [[NIFL Championship]]. The club, founded in 1963, hails from [[Portadown]] and plays its home matches at the BMG Arena. The club's home colours are all red at home and all white away. Annagh United are a part of the [[Mid-Ulster F.A.|Mid-Ulster Football Association]]. The club plays in the [[Irish Cup]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Mid Ulster Football Association |url=https://midulsterfa.co.uk/ |access-date=2025-12-03 |website=midulsterfa.co.uk}}</ref>"}}
